From 5a6d8326a55bd5a04f9c191af75d5e7860e38a8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:20:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): a refused-send subscription is a notice, not the
 chat's open work [daveey]

session-mentions (relay_files.subscribe_refused_chat) subscribes a human chat to a Kanban worker's own
card (tui row, delivery_metadata.reason=send_refused) when that worker is refused a cross_session send
into it, so the chat still gets the done notice. Core counted that row like a shepherd: the chat derived
`waiting` on a card it never created or watched, children inherited the row, and the Board synced a
`shepherd` chat link for it.

Live (hub, 2026-11-11): reconcile card t_01a1c0d75a11b3cd's worker (run 28388) was refused a send into
askeve-builder/20261101_014435_714d67; the Board shepherd link for that chat was written 06:06:18Z
(task_chat_links uid t_01a1c0d75a11b3cd:hub:-:20261101_014435_714d67:shepherd), 8 s after the card's
06:06:10Z block. The drop operator archived the chat at ~06:10Z and re-derived its outcome: waiting on
t_01a1c0d75a11b3cd, the very card whose drop requires that origin not to be waiting, so the drop
fail-stopped in drop_intent.

Fix: kanban_db_notify.UNCOUNTED_SUB_REASONS = (touch, send_refused); send_refused joins
OBSERVER_SUB_REASONS (never inherited). _counted_sub_clause (sidebar counts, session_tasks ->
derive_outcome, recent-done, Board chat links) and kanban_watch.held_chats skip both. add_notify_sub
never lets a notice-only reason replace a counted one (shepherd/create/origin/legacy unstamped), so a
refused send into a chat that already shepherds the card keeps that obligation. The row itself is kept:
the done notice and unseen count are unchanged.

Proof: tests/hermes_state/test_session_outcome_send_refused.py (real board, add_notify_sub,
derive_outcome): 15 RED on 66f25fad6f (archived and live chat derive `waiting`, child inherits, held_chats
and the Board shepherd link include the chat; refused send overwrites a shepherd), 20/20 GREEN; 5 controls (shepherd/create/legacy still wait,
done notice still delivered) pass before and after. 8/8 mutants of the new conditions killed. Related
suites: 12 files, 299 passed. Replay of send_refused rows on worker-2 boards and sync-shadow: 0 rows
(hub boards not readable from here). Task t_01a1c965d674710f.
